00:10:33.243 --> 00:10:38.423
Ghana's Catholic bishops ask President John Dramani Muhammad for a targeted state of emergency

00:10:38.423 --> 00:10:44.923
in communities hit by illegal mining, called Galamzi. Somalia's president Hassan Sheikh Muhammad

00:10:44.923 --> 00:10:51.083
said on Sunday that Israel and Taiwan threaten the country's existence. To really understand a

00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:55.903
separate security promise, start with the mistake of treating it as a gift that leaves the old alliance

00:10:55.903 --> 00:11:00.703
untouched. Al Jazeera's account of leaked papers obtained by the New York Times,

00:11:01.243 --> 00:11:06.503
the economist and Ukrainian outlets lays out the steps. Russia wants the North Atlantic Treaty

00:11:06.503 --> 00:11:11.703
Organization, the alliance that treats an attack on one member as an attack on all 32,

00:11:12.343 --> 00:11:16.023
to pull forces from Central and Eastern Europe and to stop adding members.

00:11:16.783 --> 00:11:21.003
Negotiator Alexey Drobinin said deals could be signed with single member states,

00:11:21.003 --> 00:11:23.703
which would then get extra guarantees from Moscow.

00:11:24.543 --> 00:11:30.503
Boris Bondarev, a former Russian diplomat who resigned over the 2022 invasion, told Al Jazeera

00:11:30.503 --> 00:11:35.383
those deals would put each European country alone opposite Russia, and would likely forbid

00:11:35.383 --> 00:11:39.443
a signer from joining a later fight between Russia and some other European state.

00:11:39.963 --> 00:11:41.283
That ban is the whole trick.

00:11:41.883 --> 00:11:46.023
Mutual defense only works if an ally is still allowed to fight when a neighbor is hit.

00:11:46.023 --> 00:11:51.543
The papers went to American envoy's Jared Kushner and Steve Whitkopf, not to European

00:11:51.543 --> 00:11:52.243
capitals.

00:11:52.843 --> 00:11:58.523
Maria Kucharenko, at a key think tank, says Moscow would rather talk to Washington, asks

00:11:58.523 --> 00:12:01.203
for everything and puts politics before security.

00:12:01.903 --> 00:12:06.823
Next time a communicate offers one country its own guarantee, look for a sentence that still

00:12:06.823 --> 00:12:09.263
lets that country fight if another ally is attacked.

00:12:09.963 --> 00:12:11.643
